                                                        style="padding:24px 0 10px 0;text-align:left;color:#172033;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.72;"
                                                        bgcolor="#ffffff" align="left">
                                                        <p>
                                                            Kindly share below documents by replying to this email to make the check out faster or you can bring them to our rental counter: 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Documents Required 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            The hirer is required to provide the following original, valid documents when renting a vehicle from Route Facile. All documents have to be under the hirer's name: 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Residents of Morocco:
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical Moroccan driving licence if less than one year, you can support it with your home country driver's license.  
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical passport copy (with visa page) or National ID. 
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical credit card must be presented at the time of pick-up for security deposit. 
                                                            </li>
                                                        </ul>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Tourists: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid home country driver license.   
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid passport. 
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical credit card for security deposit. 
                                                            </li>
                                                        </ul>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Non-Residents of Morocco: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid international/home country driving license. (Refer to driving license exemptions list below) 
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical passport/visit visa copy. 
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Valid physical credit card for security deposit.   
                                                            </li>
                                                        </ul>

                                                        <p>
                                                            Note: A customer can also use a credit card belonging to a friend or family member as a guarantee; however, that person must accompany the customer at the time of rental. 
                                                        </p>
                                                        
                                                        <p>All rentals are subject to standard terms and conditions of the Route Facile Agreement in effect at the time and place of rental.  </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Rental Length:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            The minimum rental duration is one day (24 hours). Rentals, less than 24 hours will be charged as a full-day rental. Likewise, additional day charges will apply if the vehicle is kept longer than the specified time. Additional day rental will begin after a 1-hour grace period and will be billed at the applicable public rate. 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            The hirer is not allowed to rent more than 1 vehicle at the same time. If the hirer has an existing active booking/rental that coincides with a new booking’s scheduled pick-up, Route Facile have the right to refuse the new booking 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Types of Short-Term Rentals and Mileage: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
