                                                        <p>
                                                            Customers with a Monthly Rental Agreement (MRA) or Long-Term Agreement can drive 3,000 – 6000 KM per month, depending on the selected monthly plan and vehicle. Any additional mileage beyond the agreed limit will be charged at MAD 0.50 to MAD 1.00, depending on the vehicle. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Car Category:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Specific make or model preferences are subject to availability at the time of rental; only a car category can be confirmed. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Security Deposit/Pre-authorization:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            A Security Deposit/Pre-authorization of between MAD 1000 - 2500 will be blocked at the time of rental. This will be used against non-rental dues i.e. Traffic Fines/Salik Charges, any damages etc. The pre-authorized amount will be released after 30 days from the date of closing the contract. Cash deposits are not accepted
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Route Facile reserves the right to charge the credit card without prior notification for the amount due, including traffic fines, insurance excess, road toll charges (Salik/Darb), refuelling charges and any damages incurred by the customer during the rental period.Shape 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
