                                                        <p>
                                                            Please note that in case the renter’s Visit or Tourist visa in Morocco is changed to a Residence visa, he will need to get a Morocco driving license which has to be submitted to Route Facile Immediately along with residence visa page. It is illegal to drive on international license if your visa is changed to a residence visa. 
