                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Payment Method 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Bookings are reserved without payment and settled when you collect the car.  
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            “All credit/debit card details and personally identifiable information will NOT be stored, sold, shared, rented, or leased to any third parties”.  
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Payment can also be made in cash for rentals and extras (GPS, Baby Seat, Additional Driver) at the rental counter if these were not included in the booking made on the website. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Booking Modification:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            The hirer may modify their bookings at least 12 hours prior to pick-up date and time. The total payable amount will be recalculated if the rates have changed between the dates the original and amended bookings are made. In which case, the latter prices will apply.   
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Booking Cancellation: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            <ul>
                                                                <li>The hirer may cancel their prepaid booking at least 24 hours prior to pick up date and time and will receive a full refund.</li>
                                                                <li>A cancellation fee of one-day rental will be applicable for cancellations made less than 24 hours. Refunds, where applicable, will be made to the credit card used on the original prepaid booking within 30 calendar days.</li>
                                                                <li>Failure to provide the required documentation, as outlined in the booking terms and conditions, will result in a cancellation fee of one-day rental.</li>
                                                            </ul>
                                                            <p>
                                                                <strong> Note</strong> A 6% processing fee will be deducted from all approved refunds.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                No Show: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            If the customer fails to collect the vehicle on the rental start date and time and does not notify Route Facile in advance, a one-day rental fee will be charged to the customer.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Late Arrival: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            If the customer fails to collect the car within 4 hours of the scheduled pickup time, Route Facile reserves the right not to honor the booking. However, the vehicle may still be provided, subject to availability. The pick-up and drop-off timings stated on the voucher will remain unchanged. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Premature Termination: 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            For Daily/Weekly Rentals: There will be no refund for unused car rental days once a Daily or Weekly rental has started. 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            For monthly rentals, there is no refund for early return during 1st month. If the vehicle is returned early in the following months, the monthly plan will be automatically cancelled, and a pro-rata rate will be applied accordingly. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Fuel Policy:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            The vehicle should be returned at the same fuel level as it had at the time of vehicle check out. Failing to do so, refuelling charges at 20% of the fuel cost will be applied. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Age limit:   
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Renters must be 21 years old for vehicles in car groups B to E. For car groups G to G3, renters must be at least 25 years old. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Delivery & Collection to Customer Address:
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            We can collect and deliver cars to the customer’s selected address within city limits during normal office hours in Marrakech, Casablanca, Rabat, Agadir, Tangier, Fes, Tetouan and Ouarzazate. Additional charges may apply based on the rental duration. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Delivery & Collection (Virtual Locations): 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            We can collect and deliver cars to designated locations across Morocco. These are not physical locations but are used as delivery and collection points. Our team will coordinate with the customers once the booking is confirmed. There are no delivery or collection charges for these locations. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Inter Cities Charges (Pickup-Return): 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Inter-city fees are charged (per trip) if the City where the vehicle is to be picked up is different from the City where it will be returned to. Please call your respective branch to check the specific rates depending on the Cities you booked. 
                                                        </p>
                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Rates range from MAD 50 – 200 per trip and will be charged depending on which Cities is booked. 
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li>
                                                                Below are the Cities where we have branches: 
                                                                Marrakech, Casablanca, Rabat, Agadir, Tangier, Fes, Tetouan and Ouarzazate 
                                                            </li>
                                                        </ul>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Insurance:  
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            A valid police report is mandatory. Please check with the agent at the rental branch for more information. 
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <strong>
                                                                Super Collision Damage Waiver (SCDW) 
                                                            </strong>
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Purchase of SCDW reduces the customer’s liability to ZERO. Renters will not be paying anything to Route Facile for damage or repairs. NOTE: A valid police report is mandatory. The insurance will not be valid if the police report is not provided.
                                                        </p>
